<title>USA: Enstar Group to buy back $5 mln in stock.</title>
<headline>Enstar Group to buy back $5 mln in stock.</headline>
<dateline>MONTGOMERY, Ala. 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Enstar Group said Wednesday it will buy back up to five million dollars worth of its common stock, starting on July 11.</p>
<p>The purchases will be made from time to time on the open market when the company deems the price to be favorable.</p>
<p>Enstar said in a statement that it anticipates using borrowed funds to pay for the purchases and then using the proceeds from sales of its common stock holdings in First Union Corp to pay back this debt.</p>
</text>
